      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the descendants of Esau (that is, Edom). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.26.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 26.34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.28.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "28.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Esau took his wives from the Canaanites: Adah the daughter of Elon the Hittite, Oholibamah the daughter of Anah the son",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36.2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Sam Gk Syr: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "daughter",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " of Zibeon the Hivite, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Basemath, Ishmael's daughter, the sister of Nebaioth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Adah bore to Esau, Eliphaz; Basemath bore Reuel; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Oholibamah bore Jeush, Jalam, and Korah. These are the sons of Esau who were born to him in the land of Canaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Esau took his wives, his sons, his daughters, and all the members of his household, his cattle, all his beasts, and all his property which he had acquired in the land of Canaan; and he went into a land away from his brother Jacob. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For their possessions were too great for them to dwell together; the land of their sojournings could not support them because of their cattle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Esau dwelt in the hill country of Seir; Esau is Edom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the descendants of Esau the father of the Edomites in the hill country of Seir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the names of Esau's sons: Eliphaz the son of Adah the wife of Esau, Reuel the son of Basemath the wife of Esau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Eliphaz were Teman, Omar, Zepho, Gatam, and Kenaz. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Timna was a concubine of Eliphaz, Esau's son; she bore Amalek to Eliphaz.) These are the sons of Adah, Esau's wife. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the sons of Reuel: Nahath, Zerah, Shammah, and Mizzah. These are the sons of Basemath, Esau's wife. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the sons of Oholibamah the daughter of Anah the son",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36.14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk Syr: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "daughter",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " of Zibeon, Esau's wife: she bore to Esau Jeush, Jalam, and Korah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the chiefs of the sons of Esau. The sons of Eliphaz the first-born of Esau: the chiefs Teman, Omar, Zepho, Kenaz, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korah, Gatam, and Amalek; these are the chiefs of Eliphaz in the land of Edom; they are the sons of Adah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the sons of Reuel, Esau's son: the chiefs Nahath, Zerah, Shammah, and Mizzah; these are the chiefs of Reuel in the land of Edom; they are the sons of Basemath, Esau's wife. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the sons of Oholibamah, Esau's wife: the chiefs Jeush, Jalam, and Korah; these are the chiefs born of Oholibamah the daughter of Anah, Esau's wife. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the sons of Esau (that is, Edom), and these are their chiefs.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.1.38+1CH.1.39+1CH.1.40+1CH.1.41+1CH.1.42"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Chron 1.38-42",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " These are the sons of Seir the Horite, the inhabitants of the land: Lotan, Shobal, Zibeon, Anah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dishon, Ezer, and Dishan; these are the chiefs of the Horites, the sons of Seir in the land of Edom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Lotan were Hori and Heman; and Lotan's sister was Timna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the sons of Shobal: Alvan, Manahath, Ebal, Shepho, and Onam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the sons of Zibeon: Aiah and Anah; he is the Anah who found the hot springs in the wilderness, as he pastured the asses of Zibeon his father. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the children of Anah: Dishon and Oholibamah the daughter of Anah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the sons of Dishon: Hemdan, Eshban, Ithran, and Cheran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the sons of Ezer: Bilhan, Zaavan, and Akan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the sons of Dishan: Uz and Aran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the chiefs of the Horites: the chiefs Lotan, Shobal, Zibeon, Anah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
