                "loc": "1CH.1.43+1CH.1.44+1CH.1.45+1CH.1.46+1CH.1.47+1CH.1.48+1CH.1.49+1CH.1.50+1CH.1.51+1CH.1.52+1CH.1.53"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Chron 1.43-53",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " These are the kings who reigned in the land of Edom, before any king reigned over the Israelites. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bela the son of Beor reigned in Edom, the name of his city being Dinhabah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bela died, and Jobab the son of Zerah of Bozrah reigned in his stead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jobab died, and Husham of the land of the Temanites reigned in his stead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Husham died, and Hadad the son of Bedad, who defeated Midian in the country of Moab, reigned in his stead, the name of his city being Avith. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadad died, and Samlah of Masrekah reigned in his stead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samlah died, and Shaul of Rehoboth on the Euphrates reigned in his stead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaul died, and Baal-hanan the son of Achbor reigned in his stead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baal-hanan the son of Achbor died, and Hadar reigned in his stead, the name of his city being Pau; his wife's name was Mehetabel, the daughter of Matred, daughter of Mezahab.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
